      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c075935d5cece4df39f010f|full_name}: I didn't mention IP (both kinds) at all. What are you talking about?\n\nI regularly run two accounts on two computers (one is a 'dummy' in some maps where a third dummy player is required for it to function). It's when two accounts on the same computer where things start to screw up (ie. the other account gets the permissions/avatars/data of the first, and vice versa).",
